      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.john_kalybites.budge:1-45",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲛⲉⲡⲥⲏⲟⲩ **ⲅⲁⲣ** ⲙⲡⲓϣⲱⲙ ⲛⲉ ⲛⲓⲉϩⲟⲟⲩ ⲉⲧⲉⲙⲙⲁⲩ .",
      "english": "For it was the summer at that time.",
      "source": "Life of Shenoute - part 1",
